1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,600
Assalam-o-Alaikum! Halqa NA-47 par aap ki night shift shuru ho gayi hai.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:13,900
Subah cheh bajay Fajr tak aap ne saaray Form-45 nikaal kar baayein taraf scanner par scan aur portal par upload karnay hain.

3
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:21,900
Aur haan... aakhri serial number ke Form kahin kho gaye hain, to un ko CCTV ki madad se dhoond lena...

4
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:26,400
...lekin ehtiyat rakhna ke aakhri Form uthatay huay koi dekh na le...

5
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:33,600
...agar wahan koi mojood ho to uske jaanay ka intezaar karna aur phir Form uthana.

6
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:40,300
Raat ko bahar ka mahaul thora ajeeb hota hai, is liye ehtiyat laazmi rakhna...

7
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:48,200
...CCTV cameras aur chhoti khirkiyon se bahar zaroor dekhtay rehna, aur jab bahar koi nazar aaye toh scan mat karna.

8
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:53,600
Agar koi darwazay ya khirki ke qareeb aaye toh kundi aur shutter band kar lena...

9
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:59,100
...aur zaroorat paray toh deewar par tangay hathoray se unki marammat bhi kar lena.

10
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:04,900
Haan, daaein taraf ketli mein chai ubaal kar CAM 01 par Chacha Chowkidar ko bhejtay rehna taakay woh gate par jaagtay rahein...

11
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:08,500
...aur WiFi ka masla ho toh CAM 10 mein router dekh lena.

12
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:13,500
Yaad rakhna, aap ke paas subha 6 bajay tak ka waqt hai aur UPS ki battery aur Form-45 ki hifazat karna.

13
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:15,500
Aur haan... Apna khayal rakhna!
